            "displayAsButton": false,
            "buttonSize": "big",
            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Carlos Chagas</strong><br>\nCarlos Chagas was born on July 9, 1879, in Oliveira, Minas Gerais, Brazil. As a young man, he was interested in the natural sciences and medicine, which led him to pursue a medical degree. He graduated with honors from the Medical School of Rio de Janeiro in 1902. After his graduation, he began working at the Oswaldo Cruz Institute, which was at the forefront of biomedical research in Brazil.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Discovery of Chagas Disease</strong><br>\nWhile working in the state of Minas Gerais, Carlos Chagas discovered a new infectious disease in 1909, which he named \"Chagas disease.\" It was caused by the parasite Trypanosoma cruzi, transmitted to humans by an insect vector, the triatomine bug. This was the first time a disease was discovered in its entirety, from the pathogen to the vector and clinical signs.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Research and Challenges</strong><br>\nChagas faced many challenges in his research. The region where he worked was remote, and he often had to travel long distances to study patients and insects. Despite these difficulties, he documented the lifecycle of the Trypanosoma cruzi and detailed the disease's transmission, which was a remarkable achievement given the limited scientific tools of his time.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
